<title>USA: LG Electronics to resell NCR servers.</title>
<headline>LG Electronics to resell NCR servers.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>LG Electronics, a division of the $64 billion Korean conglomerate LG Group, has reached an agreement with NCR Corp to resell its servers in Korea, the company said Monday.</p>
<p>LG said it will resell NCR's WorldMark 4300 servers in order to reinforce its existing line of entry-level to mid-range servers.</p>
<p>NCR will make the computer systems for LG Electronics, which will in turn market them to its base of corporate customers, it said.</p>
<p>NCR said it signed a similar agreement with Sequent Computer Systems Inc in January.</p>
</text>
